            <ArticleTitle>Obesity care strategies in primary care practices.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>152-5.e1</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.jpeds.2012.03.022</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We evaluated pediatric obesity clinics for internal referrals developed at 5 primary care offices. Clinics developed site-specific strategies: 1 group approach and 4 clinics providing individualized care only. Clinicians reported patient/family motivation as an important referral consideration and compliance as the greatest challenge and perceive clinics to have provided some help.</AbstractText>
